[CENTER][IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/UltraKits/assets/banner.png[/IMG]

[SIZE=5][B]Kits with previews, cooldowns & in-game editor.[/B][/SIZE]

UltraKits makes kits easy: create them in-game from your own inventory, offer them in a GUI and limit them by cooldown, price or permission.
UltraKits is part of the [B][COLOR=#8B5CF6]Ultra[/COLOR][COLOR=#22D3EE]Plugins[/COLOR][/B] series: every plugin shares the same colours, the same message layout and the same command structure.

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-features.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST]
[*]Kit GUI with a preview of every kit
[*]In-game editor: create a kit straight from your inventory
[*]Cooldowns, one-time kits, costs and permissions
[*]First-join kit for new players
[*]Armour is equipped automatically
[*]Kits can run commands as well
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-layout.png[/IMG]

No chat spam. Every confirmation, countdown and status appears in the [B]action bar[/B].
Only [B][COLOR=#F87171]errors[/COLOR][/B] are sent to the chat, so players never miss them.
All messages use MiniMessage and can be changed in the language files.

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/UltraKits/assets/preview.png[/IMG]

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-languages.png[/IMG]

[B]English · Deutsch · Français · Nederlands · Italiano[/B]
Every player sees UltraKits in the language of their Minecraft client – automatically.
Players with any other language get your default language, which you set in the config or with [FONT=Courier New]/ultrakits language <code>[/FONT].
All texts live in [FONT=Courier New]lang/<code>.yml[/FONT] and can be edited freely.

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-commands.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/kit [name] [spieler][/COLOR][/FONT] – Claim a kit (give to others: ultrakits.give) [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrakits.kit)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/kits[/COLOR][/FONT] – Open the kit GUI [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrakits.kit)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/createkit <name>[/COLOR][/FONT] – Create a kit from your inventory [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrakits.create)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/editkit <name> <items|cooldown|cost|onetime|firstjoin|icon>[/COLOR][/FONT] – Edit a kit [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrakits.edit)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/delkit <name>[/COLOR][/FONT] – Delete a kit [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrakits.delete)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/ultrakits <help|reload|version|language>[/COLOR][/FONT] – Administration [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrakits.admin)[/COLOR]
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-permissions.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST]
[*][FONT=Courier New]ultrakits.kit.<name>[/FONT] – Access to a specific kit
[*][FONT=Courier New]ultrakits.bypass.cooldown[/FONT] – Skip the cooldown
[*][FONT=Courier New]ultrakits.*[/FONT] – Everything
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-installation.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST=1]
[*]Download UltraKits and drop the jar into your [FONT=Courier New]plugins[/FONT] folder (Paper 1.20.4+, Java 17+).
[*]Restart your server.
[*]Adjust [FONT=Courier New]config.yml[/FONT] and the files in [FONT=Courier New]lang/[/FONT], then run [FONT=Courier New]/ultrakits reload[/FONT].
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-series.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST]
[*][B]UltraSpawn[/B] – Spawn management done right.
[*][B]UltraTeleports[/B] – Requests, random teleport & back in one plugin.
[*][B]UltraPunish[/B] – Clean moderation with GUI, templates & history.
[*][B]UltraHomes[/B] – Set, manage and share homes in one GUI.
[*][B]UltraWarps[/B] – Server & player warps with categories.
[*][B]UltraChat[/B] – Formatting, channels & moderation for your chat.
[*][B]UltraEconomy[/B] – Fast, Vault-ready economy with multiple currencies.
[*][B]UltraVanish[/B] – True invisibility for your staff team.
[*][B]UltraReports[/B] – Player reports with a staff GUI workflow.
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-support.png[/IMG]

Found a bug or have an idea? Please use the discussion tab or send a private message instead of leaving a bad review. We answer every request.[/CENTER]
